          "TitleHtml": "<div class=\"chunk-title\">SEC. 1-101. - REFERENCE TO CODE.</div>",
          "ShouldShowMiniToc": false,
          "Id": "MUCOFR_CH1GEPR_ART1GEPR_S1-101RECO",
          "Title": "SEC. 1-101. - REFERENCE TO CODE.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               This Code may at all times be referred to as the \"Municipal Code of the City of Fresno\"\n               or \"Fresno Municipal Code\" and whenever cited in an ordinance, may be referred to\n               as \"this Code\". It shall be sufficient to designate any ordinance adding to, amending\n               or repealing this Code as an addition or amendment to, or repeal of, the \"Municipal\n               Code of the City of Fresno\" or \"Fresno Municipal Code.\" Also, in any prosecution for\n               the violation of any provision of this Code, it shall be sufficient to designate this\n               Code as the \"Municipal Code of the City of Fresno\" or \"Fresno Municipal Code\".\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Orig. Ord. 4789; Am. Ord. 98-62, \u00a7 1, eff. 10-1-98; Am. Ord. 2007-55, \u00a7 4, eff. 9-4-07).\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
