          "TitleHtml": "<div class=\"chunk-title\">SEC. 1-102. - EFFECT ON PAST ACTIONS AND OBLIGATIONS PREVIOUSLY ACCRUED.</div>",
          "ShouldShowMiniToc": false,
          "Id": "MUCOFR_CH1GEPR_ART1GEPR_S1-102EFPAACOBPRAC",
          "Title": "SEC. 1-102. - EFFECT ON PAST ACTIONS AND OBLIGATIONS PREVIOUSLY ACCRUED.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               Neither the adoption of this Code nor the repeal hereby of any ordinance of this city\n               shall in any manner affect the prosecution for violations of ordinances, which violations\n               were committed prior to the effective date hereof, nor be construed as a waiver of\n               any license or penalty at said effective date due and unpaid under such ordinances,\n               nor be construed as affecting any of the provisions of such ordinances relating to\n               the collection of any such license or penalty or the penal provisions applicable to\n               any violation thereof, nor to affect the validity of any bond or cash deposit in lieu\n               thereof, required to be posted, filed or deposited pursuant to any ordinance, and\n               all rights and obligations thereof appertaining shall continue in full force and effect.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Orig. Ord. 4789; Am. Ord. 98-62, \u00a7 1, eff. 10-1-98; Am. Ord. 2007-55, \u00a7 4, eff. 9-4-07).\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
